E013_missing_return.cmm:2:4: semantic error: function 'foo' does not return a value on all paths
  |
2 | fn foo() -> int {
  |    ^^^
what went wrong:
  The function 'foo' promises to give back a int, but in some cases it
  reaches the end without giving anything back.
how to fix:
  Make sure every possible path ends with 'return <int value>;'. For example
  add this as the last line of the function:
      return 0;
